# Application-callable functions with few cases elsewhere, called from
# bound functions (defun) inside readline so their effect on the line,
# the undo list and the display can be observed.
tags: emacs api

=== forward-backward-aliases
tags: rl_forward rl_backward
--- script
def b
rl_backward 2 0
dump
rl_forward 1 0
dump
rl_backward -3 0
dump
end
defun t b
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xt" t
readline "> "
--- keys
abcdef\C-a\C-f\C-f\C-f\C-xt\r

=== forward-backward-aliases-bounds
tags: rl_forward rl_backward
--- script
def b
rl_forward 10 0
dump
rl_backward 99 0
dump
end
defun t b
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xt" t
readline "> "
--- keys
abc\C-a\C-xt\r

=== forward-backward-utf8
tags: rl_forward rl_backward utf8
--- script
def b
rl_backward 1 0
dump
rl_forward 1 0
dump
end
defun t b
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xt" t
readline "> "
--- keys
aéü\C-xt\r

