=== undo-groups-api
tags: rl_begin_undo_group rl_end_undo_group rl_do_undo
--- script
def b
rl_begin_undo_group
rl_insert_text "one "
rl_insert_text "two "
rl_end_undo_group
rl_insert_text "three"
dumpfull
end
defun t b
rl_bind_keyseq "\C-xt" t
readline "> "
--- keys
\C-xt\C-_<dump>\C-_<dump>\r

